\b\fs24 Note:
\b0  Resolutions which exceed the size of the LCD display, such as 1024x768 when using a ThinkPad 760ED, will require an external monitor (CRT). If a CRT is not detected, then the driver will default to the maximum resolution supported by the LCD display.
\fc1\cf1 \

\fs16 \

\b\fs24\fc0\cf0 Note:
\b0  The IBM ThinkPad 760E/760ED display does not support gamma correction in 16-bit modes, causing the Brightness slider in the Preferences app not to work for 16-bit modes. This behavior 
\fc1\cf1 is due to the absence of a feature in the hardware itself; no software work around is available. 
\fc0\cf0 \

